  clock: 4  # c08e
  nonce: c08e  # c08e
  message: "PARITY PART DONE in PR #1292 (dev 97ff6e24ef + f12ca53d8e + 24735aac13): window.location moved host_info_read -> env_read beside document.location; document's row note now records why it stays env_read. Re-verified on merged dev: const u = window.location.href; fetch(url + u) -> host_secret -> network VIOLATED 1 flow (was CONFIRMED 0, host_info_read). A/B on 8 JS/TS repos (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/dadu_09292026/RESULT.md): 8 verdicts inconclusive -> violated, flows +47 / -15 where all 15 '-' are the same window.location flows relabelled host_description -> host_secret. Read back: growthbook oauth/callback.tsx POSTs window.location.search/hash (the OAuth code) with fetch -- the credential-in-URL case, previously invisible to host_secret claims. This item stays VIOLATED for its re-scoped statement (no untrusted_input source), blocked on WI-nokab."  # c08e
